#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:17
msgid ""
"Eclipse Cyclone DDS is an open-source Data Distribution Service (DDS) "
"implementation for ROS systems that need a performant and robust middleware "
"option. This article describes how to install ``rmw_cyclonedds``, select it "
"as your active RMW implementation, and verify that it is working. After you "
"follow these steps, you can run ROS nodes using Eclipse Cyclone DDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:21
msgid ""
"Eclipse Cyclone DDS is a very performant and robust open-source DDS "
"implementation. Cyclone DDS is developed completely in the open as an "
"Eclipse IoT project. See also: https://projects.eclipse.org/projects/iot."
"cyclonedds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:31
msgid "Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:34
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:36
msgid ""
"Have :doc:`rosdep installed <../../../../ROS-Framework/client-libraries/"
"Working-with-Client-Libraries/Rosdep>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:39
msgid "Install packages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:41
msgid "The easiest way is to install from ROS 2 apt repository."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:43
msgid "$ sudo apt install ros-rolling-rmw-cyclonedds-cpp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:48
msgid "Build from source code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:50
msgid "Building from source code is also another way to install."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:52
msgid ""
"First, clone Cyclone DDS and rmw_cyclonedds in the ROS 2 workspace source "
"directory. To determine the correct branches to checkout, you need to find "
"what versions are specified in your `ROS distribution's ros2.repos file "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/refs/heads/rolling/ros2."
"repos>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:55
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can run the following code to fetch the correct branch/"
"tag needed for Cyclone DDS:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:57
msgid ""
"$ CYCLONEDDS_BRANCH=$(curl -s https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/"
"refs/heads/rolling/ros2.repos | grep -A 3 \"eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds:\" "
"| grep \"version:\" | awk '{print $2}')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:61
msgid "And now, clone and checkout the code:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:63
msgid ""
"$ cd ros2_ws/src\n"
"$ git clone https://github.com/ros2/rmw_cyclonedds ros2/rmw_cyclonedds -b "
"rolling\n"
"$ git clone https://github.com/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds eclipse-"
"cyclonedds/cyclonedds -b ${CYCLONEDDS_BRANCH}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:69
msgid "Then, install necessary packages for Cyclone DDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:71
msgid ""
"$ cd ..\n"
"$ rosdep install --from src -i"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:76
msgid "Finally, run colcon build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:78
msgid "$ colcon build --symlink-install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:83
msgid "Switch to rmw_cyclonedds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:85
msgid ""
"Switch from other rmw to rmw_cyclonedds by specifying the environment "
"variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:87
msgid "$ export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_cyclonedds_cpp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:91
msgid ""
"See also: :doc:`Working with multiple RMW implementations <../Working-with-"
"multiple-RMW-implementations>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:94
msgid "Run the talker and listener"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:96
msgid "Now run ``talker`` and ``listener`` to test Cyclone DDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:98
msgid ""
"$ source /opt/ros/rolling/setup.bash\n"
"$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp talker"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:103
msgid ""
"$ source /opt/ros/rolling/setup.bash\n"
"$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp listener"
msgstr ""
